  <p>Confirm this address to finish setting up your Dabet account.</p>
  <p><a href="{{.VerifyURL}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;background:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px">Confirm email address</a></p>
